# Docs path drift: confirmed, activation blocked by runner behavior

Read-only investigation after successful Tailscale reauthentication.
No unit, drop-in, script, timer, application, firewall or Tailnet change made.
No service test or daemon-reload performed. No production Git checkout changed.

