4644acf (Final correction pass after bulk sweep, PR29). No remote freshness
or remote write test is claimed for this Docs repository.
/opt/tu1nz_repos/docs_repo does not exist, including as a dangling symlink.
The active systemd drop-in alone directs this job there. Runner and builder
both use /opt/tu1nz_repos/docs. User/group chatops, HOME=/home/chatops.
Base ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/tu1nz_doc_auto.sh. Timer enabled, active/waiting,
