## Additional blocking finding
The current builder tu1nz_doc_update.sh appends plain text with echo to a
System_Dokumentation_Tausendunde1nz_DATE.pdf filename. It performs no PDF
rendering or validation. The single matching existing daily file dated
2026-03-15 is67bytes and lacks the %PDF- signature. Its contents were not printed.
Runner suppresses builder and staging failures with ||true, stages the dated
file, commits all staged changes if present, then immediately pushes origin/main.
It also uses unrestricted git reset in its no-change path. Therefore a path-only
repair re-enables a job that can report misleading success, publish a non-PDF,
or include concurrent staged work. The present clean index does not remove
these design issues. The requested review-before-push cannot be satisfied by
an unmodified normal test run of this runner.

## Decision and bounded next change
Stop before activation, as required for unexpected scope expansion and failed
safety gates. No empty replacement directory or symlink was created.
A separately scoped runner/builder correction is needed: establish the intended
output format/content, produce and validate that artifact, stage only it after
clean-index/concurrency checks, expose a no-push test mode, propagate errors,
and review the exact resulting commit before any push. Only then correct the
single WorkingDirectory reference with a timestamped backup and tested rollback.
Do not silently choose an existing similarly named generator without inspecting
its output contract and side effects. No MyChatBuddy component may be touched.
Phase4 and Phase5 remain unactivated. No further broad health claim is made.

